,"s":"ده دلار است.","pr":"ایتس تِن دالِرز","a":"audio/en-fa/9d908b1d1bab.mp3"},{"id":"p04","t":"Can I help you?","s":"می‌توانم کمکتان کنم؟","pr":"کَن آی هِلپ یو؟","a":"audio/en-fa/25b82cc4984c.mp3"},{"id":"p05","t":"I'm just looking.","s":"فقط نگاه می‌کنم.","pr":"آیم جاست لوکینگ","a":"audio/en-fa/6045bc98a300.mp3"},{"id":"p06","t":"What color is it?","s":"چه رنگی است؟","pr":"وات کالِر ایز ایت؟","a":"audio/en-fa/2d725f5d2650.mp3"},{"id":"p07","t":"It's too big.","s":"زیادی بزرگ است.","pr":"ایتس تو بیگ","a":"audio/en-fa/7cf6a9899c9e.mp3"},{"id":"p08","t":"Here you are.","s":"بفرمایید.","pr":"هیر یو آر","a":"audio/en-fa/ffbb0dd0fb8a.mp3"}],"dialogue":{"title":{"t":"At the clothing store","s":"در مغازهٔ لباس‌فروشی","a":"audio/en-fa/83389d6f25d9.mp3"},"speakers":{"A":{"name":"Tom","voice":"m"},"B":{"name":"Neda","voice":"f"}},"lines":[{"sp":"A","t":"Hello. Can I help you?","s":"سلام. می‌توانم کمکتان کنم؟","a":"audio/en-fa/6725ec8c8cdd.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Yes, please. How much is this scarf?","s":"بله، لطفاً. این شال‌گردن چند است؟","a":"audio/en-fa/1d195d88f98a.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"The green scarf? It's five dollars.","s":"شال‌گردن سبز؟ پنج دلار است.","a":"audio/en-fa/6b9c03f1c3b0.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"And that bag?","s":"آن کیف چطور؟","a":"audio/en-fa/52aa2f39e1a9.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"The black bag is twenty dollars.","s":"کیف مشکی بیست دلار است.","a":"audio/en-fa/9cb9a7dd7951.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Hmm. And how much are those shoes?","s":"هوم. آن کفش‌ها چند است؟","a":"audio/en-fa/e9091a857ba4.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"These white shoes? They're fifteen dollars.","s":"این کفش‌های سفید؟ پانزده دلار است.","a":"audio/en-fa/0c5eb75b0d47.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"OK. I'd like the scarf and the shoes, please.","s":"باشه. شال‌گردن و کفش‌ها را می‌خواهم، لطفاً.","a":"audio/en-fa/7a02f8f4c796.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"That's twenty dollars, please.","s":"می‌شود بیست دلار، لطفاً.","a":"audio/en-fa/e0c2bc5ef9e3.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Here you are.","s":"بفرمایید.","a":"audio/en-fa/ffbb0dd0fb8a.mp3"}]},"grammar":[{"id":"g01","title":{"t":"this / that / these / those","s":"این / آن / این‌ها / آن‌ها"},"explain":"برای چیزی که **نزدیک** ماست، **this** (این) و برای چیزی که **دور** است، **that** (آن) می‌گوییم.\nبرای چند چیز (جمع): **these** (این‌ها) و **those** (آن‌ها).\nبعد از this و that فعل **is** می‌آید: **This shirt is blue.**\nبعد از these و those فعل **are** می‌آید: **These shoes are black.**\nنکته: **pants** (شلوار) در انگلیسی همیشه جمع است: **These pants are black.**","table":[["this shirt","these shirts"],["that shirt","those shirts"]],"examples":[{"t":"This bag is red.","s":"این کیف قرمز است.","a":"audio/en-fa/e32a1862d2c6.mp3"},{"t":"That coat is black.","s":"آن کت مشکی است.","a":"audio/en-fa/f785850410f2.mp3"},{"t":"These shoes are white.","s":"این کفش‌ها سفید هستند.","a":"audio/en-fa/a648b0771743.mp3"},{"t":"Those T-shirts are green.","s":"آن تی‌شرت‌ها سبز هستند.","a":"audio/en-fa/151416360bd7.mp3"},{"t":"I like these pants.","s":"من این شلوار را دوست دارم.","a":"audio/en-fa/0eff81e03324.mp3"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","t":"___ shoes are black.","options":["This","These","That"],"answer":1,"s":"این کفش‌ها مشکی هستند.","full":"These shoes are black.","a":"audio/en-fa/3ae3787bff54.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"___ bag is blue.","options":["That","Those","These"],"answer":0,"s":"آن کیف آبی است.","full":"That bag is blue.","a":"audio/en-fa/2eb50d6cf3e7.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"These shirts ___ white.","options":["is","am","are"],"answer":2,"s":"این پیراهن‌ها سفید هستند.","full":"These shirts are white.","a":"audio/en-fa/fbc02af9592b.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"___ coat is red.","answer":["This"],"s":"این کت قرمز است.","full":"This coat is red.","a":"audio/en-fa/d40c7eb64e81.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"___ T-shirts are yellow.","answer":["Those"],"s":"آن تی‌شرت‌ها زرد هستند.","full":"Those T-shirts are yellow.","a":"audio/en-fa/3f8ebd4a7f4f.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"I like this green scarf.","s":"من این شال‌گردن سبز را دوست دارم.","full":"I like this green scarf.","a":"audio/en-fa/2432db2e6122.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Those pants ___ black.","options":["are","is"],"answer":0,"s":"آن شلوار مشکی است.","full":"Those pants are black.","a":"audio/en-fa/684b84270f6d.mp3"}]},{"id":"g02","title":{"t":"How much is it? / a red dress","s":"پرسیدن قیمت و جای رنگ در جمله"},"explain":"برای پرسیدن قیمت یک چیز می‌گوییم: **How much is it?** یا **How much is this shirt?**\nبرای چیزهای جمع: **How much are they?** یا **How much are these shoes?**\nجواب: **It's ten dollars.** / **They're ten dollars.** (ده دلار است.)\nدر انگلیسی **رنگ قبل از اسم** می‌آید، برعکسِ فارسی: **a red dress** (یک لباس قرمز)، **black shoes** (کفش مشکی).\nرنگ‌ها هیچ‌وقت جمع بسته نمی‌شوند: **red shoes** (نه reds shoes).","table":[["How much is","this bag?"],["How much are","these shoes?"],["a + color + thing","a blue shirt"]],"examples":[{"t":"How much is this T-shirt? It's twelve dollars.","s":"این تی‌شرت چند است؟ دوازده دلار است.","a":"audio/en-fa/3e3dcff9e243.mp3"},{"t":"How much are these shoes? They're twenty dollars.","s":"این کفش‌ها چند است؟ بیست دلار است.","a":"audio/en-fa/5c72d4c5d95b.mp3"},{"t":"I'd like a white shirt, please.","s":"یک پیراهن سفید می‌خواهم، لطفاً.","a":"audio/en-fa/727fff9fe89c.mp3"},{"t":"Sara has a green bag.","s":"سارا یک کیف سبز دارد.","a":"audio/en-fa/021911a13f6f.mp3"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","t":"How much ___ this scarf?","options":["is","are"],"answer":0,"s":"این شال‌گردن چند است؟","full":"How much is this scarf?","a":"audio/en-fa/d43ac86132ad.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"How much ___ these pants?","options":["is","are"],"answer":1,"s":"این شلوار چند است؟","full":"How much are these pants?","a":"audio/en-fa/44737f41c48c.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"I'd like a ___, please.","options":["bag red","red bag","reds bag"],"answer":1,"s":"یک کیف قرمز می‌خواهم، لطفاً.","full":"I'd like a red bag, please.","a":"audio/en-fa/fff7f6ea040a.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"How much is this coat?","s":"این کت چند است؟","full":"How much is this coat?","a":"audio/en-fa/1cf7bd639b3f.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"She has a blue dress.","s":"او یک لباس آبی دارد.","full":"She has a blue dress.","a":"audio/en-fa/314d2f5ee0e8.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"How ___ is it?","answer":["much"],"s":"قیمتش چقدر است؟","full":"How much is it?","a":"audio/en-fa/6d65c7ebc0e2.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"It's fifteen ___.","answer":["dollars"],"s":"پانزده دلار است.","full":"It's fifteen dollars.","a":"audio/en-fa/3e05e43bb715.mp3"}]}],"reading":{"title":{"t":"At the clothing store","s":"در مغازهٔ لباس‌فروشی","a":"audio/en-fa/83389d6f25d9.mp3"},"text":[{"t":"Maryam and her daughter Neda are at a clothing store.","s":"مریم و دخترش ندا در یک مغازهٔ لباس‌فروشی هستند.","a":"audio/en-fa/c6fa540af355.mp3"},{"t":"Neda likes red. She would like a red dress.","s":"ندا رنگ قرمز را دوست دارد. او یک لباس قرمز می‌خواهد.","a":"audio/en-fa/1bee9ee7a14e.mp3"},{"t":"The red dress is eighteen dollars.","s":"لباس قرمز هجده دلار است.","a":"audio/en-fa/000b4580b362.mp3"},{"t":"Maryam likes the black coat, but it's too big.","s":"مریم کت مشکی را دوست دارد، اما زیادی بزرگ است.","a":"audio/en-fa/ecbe0273f8aa.mp3"},{"t":"There are some white T-shirts next to the coats.","s":"کنار کت‌ها چند تی‌شرت سفید هست.","a":"audio/en-fa/3eb39ac63f60.mp3"},{"t":"They are six dollars.","s":"قیمتشان شش دلار است.","a":"audio/en-fa/ad508602ab70.mp3"},{"t":"Maryam would like a white T-shirt for Amir.","s":"مریم یک تی‌شرت سفید برای امیر می‌خواهد.","a":"audio/en-fa/e0d623095f5a.mp3"},{"t":"Amir is her son.","s":"امیر پسرِ اوست.","a":"audio/en-fa/243a3b127148.mp3"}],"questions":[{"q":{"t":"What color is Neda's dress?","s":"لباس ندا چه رنگی است؟","a":"audio/en-fa/eb25221c63b5.mp3"},"options":["red","black","white"],"answer":0},{"q":{"t":"How much is the red dress?","s":"لباس قرمز چند است؟","a":"audio/en-fa/6ce0a5f32336.mp3"},"options":["eight dollars","eighteen dollars","twenty dollars"],"answer":1},{"q":{"t":"How much are the white T-shirts?","s":"تی‌شرت‌های سفید چند است؟","a":"audio/en-fa/f3728934317e.mp3"},"options":["sixteen dollars","ten dollars","six dollars"],"answer":2},{"q":{"t":"Who is Amir?","s":"امیر کیست؟","a":"audio/en-fa/42ff2fc9ad4b.mp3"},"options":["Neda's father","Maryam's son","Maryam's brother"],"answer":1}]},"sentences":[{"t":"How much is this bag?","s":"این کیف چند است؟","a":"audio/en-fa/6d09073850e8.mp3"},{"t":"These shoes are black.","s":"این کفش‌ها مشکی هستند.","a":"audio/en-fa/3ae3787bff54.mp3"},{"t":"I'd like a blue T-shirt, please.","s":"یک تی‌شرت آبی می‌خواهم، لطفاً.","a":"audio/en-fa/d6d970ccbabe.mp3"},{"t":"That coat is too big.","s":"آن کت زیادی بزرگ است.","a":"audio/en-fa/334b04e44f86.mp3"},{"t":"Those pants are fifteen dollars.","s":"آن شلوار پانزده دلار است.","a":"audio/en-fa/52285067f64c.mp3"},{"t":"My sister has a yellow dress.","s":"خواهرم یک لباس زرد دارد.","a":"audio/en-fa/c90b653e363e.mp3"},{"t":"What color is your scarf?","s":"شال‌گردنت چه رنگی است؟","a":"audio/en-fa/de64c608565d.mp3"}],"img":"img/e/1f6cd.svg"}